 :country "MG"
 :generated "2026-11-28"
 :from 2006 :to 2040
 :note "Jours fériés, chômés et payés of Madagascar: the yearly decrees 2006-2026 (CNLEGIS): 1 January, 8 March (for women only from 2007), 29 March, Easter Sunday and Monday, 1 May, Ascension, Pentecost Sunday and Monday, 26 June, 15 August, 1 November, 25 December, 11 December 2010-2014, 14 October 2013, Eid al-Fitr and Eid al-Adha from 2013 (for Muslims only in 2013, 2014 and 2016-2018), election days and the days of additional decrees. No Sunday rule. 2010 and 2023 are gaps (MG-SECONDARY); years with no decree and from 2027: the pattern and tabular Eids."
 :gaps (2010 2023)
 :weekends ((nil 6 7))
